{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c223e0ca342d9c998f029ef7a4787a74.poster.avif?t=1767686500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c223e0ca342d9c998f029ef7a4787a74.webm?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c223e0ca342d9c998f029ef7a4787a74.mp4?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike with a randomized shop and prestige mechanics where you click balls to make A LOT of them. Make fast money or slowly ramp up to earn a huge payout. Each level has a target amount you must reach before time expires. Balance your short-term and long-term money making to get extremely rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/31df156f75cb1de149f6cfb82997aa7c.poster.avif?t=1767686500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/31df156f75cb1de149f6cfb82997aa7c.webm?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/31df156f75cb1de149f6cfb82997aa7c.mp4?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Buy progression upgrades that persist across runs. Focusing on getting paid per bounce is strong early and late game, but weak in the middle. Increasing the goal reward is good throughout but you must make sure the balls get to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/f85fdf0e26fc3c3b775841a6ff4d27bb.poster.avif?t=1767686500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/f85fdf0e26fc3c3b775841a6ff4d27bb.webm?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/f85fdf0e26fc3c3b775841a6ff4d27bb.mp4?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can go slow and play safe or click fast to make a lot of balls. Don't miss too much or you'll lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/803990db5a069e71be30eed638b66cf7.poster.avif?t=1767686500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/803990db5a069e71be30eed638b66cf7.webm?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/803990db5a069e71be30eed638b66cf7.mp4?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick between three random upgrades or buy a mulligan if you don't like any of them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever you buy an upgrade, prices go up and one random upgrade gets cheaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades to make money fast or strategize to make a cheap and efficient build.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Strategy Mode: Hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/e4f30781473e8d6e84d6a33cfab25ae2f64ba8dc.jpg"},{"name":"Aim Mode: Hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/056e614a8bee5884990b319ba3b201debe4508d3.jpg"},{"name":"Strategy Mode: Hard II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/52a9d7ad9d0f11c96067bac45939227afaec0c96.jpg"},{"name":"Aim Mode: Hard II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/ebda0161ac3ff781abb9470f118976e9520c976e.jpg"},{"name":"Strategy Mode: Harder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/62c8a24fd136d1bd2d6a38f01face96c6185baf6.jpg"},{"name":"Aim Mode: Harder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/b5ded4cc5baef0c41cb445a5353335a60bb9a934.jpg"},{"name":"Strategy Mode: Maximum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/691114a20adfa8d2ee0a066f545cb195481fed7f.jpg"},{"name":"Aim Mode: Maximum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/8270f03956c25a46f9efa199260b0346721eb67c.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665640?t=1767686500","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665640?t=1767686500","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/506da2d9e9ad21391991ca6c8eab0866b1f5e317/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767686500","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/506da2d9e9ad21391991ca6c8eab0866b1f5e317/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767686500","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c223e0ca342d9c998f029ef7a4787a74.poster.avif?t=1767686500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c223e0ca342d9c998f029ef7a4787a74.webm?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c223e0ca342d9c998f029ef7a4787a74.mp4?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike with a randomized shop and prestige mechanics where you click balls to make A LOT of them. Make fast money or slowly ramp up to earn a huge payout. Each level has a target amount you must reach before time expires. Balance your short-term and long-term money making to get extremely rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/31df156f75cb1de149f6cfb82997aa7c.poster.avif?t=1767686500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/31df156f75cb1de149f6cfb82997aa7c.webm?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/31df156f75cb1de149f6cfb82997aa7c.mp4?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Buy progression upgrades that persist across runs. Focusing on getting paid per bounce is strong early and late game, but weak in the middle. Increasing the goal reward is good throughout but you must make sure the balls get to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/f85fdf0e26fc3c3b775841a6ff4d27bb.poster.avif?t=1767686500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/f85fdf0e26fc3c3b775841a6ff4d27bb.webm?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/f85fdf0e26fc3c3b775841a6ff4d27bb.mp4?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can go slow and play safe or click fast to make a lot of balls. Don't miss too much or you'll lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/803990db5a069e71be30eed638b66cf7.poster.avif?t=1767686500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/803990db5a069e71be30eed638b66cf7.webm?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/803990db5a069e71be30eed638b66cf7.mp4?t=1767686500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick between three random upgrades or buy a mulligan if you don't like any of them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever you buy an upgrade, prices go up and one random upgrade gets cheaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades to make money fast or strategize to make a cheap and efficient build.</p>","developers":["Bergeronimo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/b303586abc4aab4f916f4bef5831b261462c74d4/header.jpg?t=1767686500","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665640/1889119597/87245fcd8bbcc2f1fa81a717cd81f451bf55fbd0/1767685705/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767686499","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665640/1889119597/87245fcd8bbcc2f1fa81a717cd81f451bf55fbd0/1767685705/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767686499","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665640/1889119597/87245fcd8bbcc2f1fa81a717cd81f451bf55fbd0/1767685705/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767686499","id":257260391,"name":"Clicker Climber: Reverse Pachinko Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257260391/cf841fc6b7304d27959dede860cadcf6932c576a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767686499"}],"name":"Clicker Climber: Reverse Pachinko","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Clicker Climber - $1.99 USD","packageid":1291408,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":199}],"title":"Buy Clicker Climber: Reverse Pachinko"}],"packages":[1291408],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><u